Package: wirecat
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: modern native stream and session utility
 Wirecat is a native utility for connecting, listening, relaying, proxying,
 transferring files, and bridging interactive sessions. It supports
 TCP, UDP, IPv4, IPv6, TLS, SOCKS5, HTTP CONNECT, PTY-backed process sessions,
 structured logging, and traffic inspection.
